From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:46:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 129/151] Status bar: click the line ending to convert to the
 other one

The line ending item no longer opens a menu: a click converts LF to CRLF,
and CRLF, CR or mixed endings to LF, in one undo step. A tooltip names the
conversion. A text without any line break has nothing to convert, so the
item is disabled there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

